{"arm": "vs", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "i": 8, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Warm editorial: cream paper, serif display type, ink-black rules, and a slow, print-magazine pace", "probability": 0.3}, {"direction": "Swiss minimal: strict modular grid, monochrome with a single accent color, and sans-serif type doing all the work", "probability": 0.25}, {"direction": "Soft aquatic: gradient washes, rounded glass cards, and gentle motion evoking a tidepool", "probability": 0.2}, {"direction": "Product-first dark mode: the landing page is a live-feeling dark calendar UI mockup that sells the tool by showing it", "probability": 0.15}, {"direction": "Neo-brutalist: raw high-contrast blocks, heavy borders, hard shadows, and loud type", "probability": 0.1}], "pick": {"direction": "Warm editorial: cream paper, serif display type, ink-black rules, and a slow, print-magazine pace", "probability": 0.3}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tidepool \u2014 Plan the week, together</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tidepool helps small teams plan their week together, before Monday gets the last word.\">\n<style>\n  /* ---------- Tokens ---------- */\n  :root {\n    --paper: #f4eee1;\n    --paper-deep: #ebe2cf;\n    --paper-shade: #e2d6bb;\n    --ink: #1c1a17;\n    --ink-soft: #4d473d;\n    --ink-faint: #7a7262;\n    --rust: #9a3b22;\n    --tide: #3e5a57;\n\n    --serif: \"Iowan Old Style\", \"Palatino Linotype\", Palatino, \"Book Antiqua\", Georgia, serif;\n    --display: \"Didot\", \"Bodoni 72\", \"Iowan Old Style\", Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --mono: ui-monospace, \"SFMono-Regular\", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n\n    --measure: 36rem;\n    --wide: 72rem;\n    --gutter: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3rem);\n    --rule-thick: 3px;\n    --rule-thin: 1px;\n    --ease-slow: cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);\n  }\n\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 0.98rem + 0.3vw, 1.2rem);\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n  }\n\n  /* subtle paper grain via layered gradients, no external assets */\n  body::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: -1;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(120,90,40,.05), transparent 40%),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(120,90,40,.06), transparent 45%);\n  }\n\n  img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }\n  a { color: inherit; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.1em; }\n  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.05; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  em { font-style: italic; }\n\n  .wrap { max-width: var(--wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--gutter); }\n\n  .skip {\n    position: absolute; left: -9999px; top: 0;\n    background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: .5rem 1rem; z-index: 100;\n  }\n  .skip:focus { left: 1rem; top: 1rem; }\n\n  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--rust); outline-offset: 3px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Rules ---------- */\n  .rule-double {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink);\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    height: 6px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .rule { border: 0; border-top: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink); margin: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Labels ---------- */\n  .kicker {\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-variant: small-caps;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: lowercase;\n    font-size: .92rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Motion: slow reveal ---------- */\n  .reveal {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(14px);\n    animation: rise 1.6s var(--ease-slow) forwards;\n  }\n  .d1 { animation-delay: .15s; }\n  .d2 { animation-delay: .4s; }\n  .d3 { animation-delay: .65s; }\n  .d4 { animation-delay: .9s; }\n\n  @keyframes rise { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n    .reveal { animation: none; opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Dateline ---------- */\n  .dateline {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    padding: .9rem 0 .7rem;\n    font-size: .85rem;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Masthead & nav ---------- */\n  .masthead { text-align: center; padding: 1.6rem 0 1.1rem; }\n  .masthead .name {\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 9vw, 6.8rem);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .masthead .tagline {\n    margin-top: .5rem;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n  }\n\n  nav.primary {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: .4rem 2rem;\n    padding: .9rem 0;\n    border-top: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    font-size: .98rem;\n  }\n  nav.primary a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    padding: .2rem 0;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(var(--ink), var(--ink));\n    background-size: 0 1px;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    background-position: 0 100%;\n    transition: background-size .8s var(--ease-slow);\n  }\n  nav.primary a:hover, nav.primary a:focus-visible { background-size: 100% 1px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font: inherit;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: .8rem 1.5rem;\n    border: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--paper);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background .6s var(--ease-slow), color .6s var(--ease-slow);\n  }\n  .btn:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); }\n  .btn.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); }\n  .btn.ghost:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }\n\n  .link-arrow {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .link-arrow:hover { color: var(--rust); border-color: var(--rust); }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .hero {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;\n    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);\n    padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6.2vw, 5.4rem);\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: .98;\n    margin: .6rem 0 1.4rem;\n  }\n  .hero h1 em { color: var(--rust); }\n  .hero .dek {\n    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1rem + .4vw, 1.35rem);\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    max-width: var(--measure);\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  }\n  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem 1.6rem; align-items: center; }\n  .fine { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-top: 1.2rem; font-style: italic; }\n\n  /* Figure: a printed week */\n  figure.week {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--paper-deep);\n    border: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink);\n    padding: 1.2rem 1.2rem 1rem;\n  }\n  .week-head {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink);\n    padding-bottom: .5rem; margin-bottom: .2rem;\n  }\n  .week-head h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n  .week-head span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }\n\n  table.plan {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: .92rem;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  table.plan th, table.plan td {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: .6rem .35rem;\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  table.plan thead th {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: .72rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink);\n  }\n  table.plan tbody th {\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    width: 4.2rem;\n    font-size: .98rem;\n  }\n  table.plan td.ink { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }\n  table.plan td.rust { background: var(--rust); color: var(--paper); }\n  table.plan td.tide { background: var(--tide); color: var(--paper); }\n  table.plan td.hatch {\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 0 5px, rgba(28,26,23,.22) 5px 6px);\n  }\n  figure.week figcaption {\n    margin-top: .8rem;\n    font-size: .88rem;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .legend { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: .6rem; font-size: .8rem; font-family: var(--mono); }\n  .legend i { display: inline-block; width: .8rem; height: .8rem; vertical-align: -1px; margin-right: .35rem; }\n\n  /* ---------- Section scaffolding ---------- */\n  section.chapter { padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) 0; }\n  section.chapter + section.chapter { border-top: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink); }\n\n  .section-head {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 14rem 1fr;\n    gap: 2rem;\n    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);\n  }\n  .section-head .num {\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    font-style: italic;\n    border-top: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink);\n    padding-top: .6rem;\n  }\n  .section-head h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.6vw, 3.6rem);\n    font-weight: 400;\n    max-width: 18ch;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Method ---------- */\n  .steps {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    border-top: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink);\n    margin-left: 16rem;\n  }\n  .step {\n    padding: 1.8rem 1.8rem 0 0;\n    border-right: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    margin-right: 1.8rem;\n  }\n  .step:last-child { border-right: 0; margin-right: 0; }\n  .step .roman {\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-size: 3.2rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--rust);\n    margin-bottom: .6rem;\n  }\n  .step h3 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin-bottom: .8rem; }\n  .step p { color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  /* ---------- Features ---------- */\n  .features {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    column-gap: 0;\n    margin-left: 16rem;\n    border-top: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n  }\n  .feature {\n    padding: 2rem 2.2rem 2.2rem 0;\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n  }\n  .feature:nth-child(odd) { border-right: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink); }\n  .feature:nth-child(even) { padding-left: 2.2rem; }\n  .feature h3 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }\n  .feature .tag {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: .72rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: .1em;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: .6rem;\n  }\n  .feature p { color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Pull quote ---------- */\n  .pull {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--paper);\n    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0;\n  }\n  .pull blockquote {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    max-width: 52rem;\n    padding: 0 var(--gutter);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .pull blockquote p {\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.8vw, 3rem);\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;\n  }\n  .pull cite {\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-variant: small-caps;\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n    color: #cfc4ac;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Pricing ---------- */\n  .pricing {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-left: 16rem;\n    width: calc(100% - 16rem);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n  .pricing th, .pricing td {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 1.4rem 1rem 1.4rem 0;\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .pricing thead th {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: .72rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: .1em;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    border-top: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink);\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    padding-top: .7rem;\n  }\n  .pricing .plan-name {\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-size: 1.9rem;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    display: block;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .pricing .price {\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-size: 2.4rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .pricing .price small { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: .9rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .pricing ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .pricing ul li::before { content: \"\u2014 \"; color: var(--rust); }\n  .pricing ul li { margin-bottom: .25rem; }\n  .pricing .pick {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-top: .4rem;\n    font-size: .75rem;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: .1em;\n    color: var(--rust);\n  }\n  .pricing-note { margin: 1.6rem 0 0 16rem; font-size: .95rem; color: var(--ink-soft); font-style: italic; }\n\n  /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */\n  .faq { margin-left: 16rem; border-top: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink); }\n  details {\n    border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    padding: 1.2rem 0;\n  }\n  details summary {\n    list-style: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  details summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    transition: transform .6s var(--ease-slow);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  details[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n  details p { margin: .9rem 0 0; max-width: 40rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  /* ---------- Closing ---------- */\n  .closing { text-align: center; padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0; }\n  .closing h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem);\n    font-weight: 400;\n    max-width: 14ch;\n    margin: .5rem auto 1.4rem;\n  }\n  .closing h2 em { color: var(--rust); }\n  .closing p { max-width: var(--measure); margin: 0 auto 2rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  form.signup {\n    display: flex;\n    max-width: 30rem;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    background: var(--paper-deep);\n  }\n  form.signup input {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n    font: inherit;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: .8rem 1rem;\n    border: 0;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  form.signup input::placeholder { color: var(--ink-faint); font-style: italic; }\n  form.signup input:focus { outline: none; }\n  form.signup button {\n    font: inherit;\n    padding: 0 1.2rem;\n    border: 0;\n    border-left: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--paper);\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  form.signup button:hover { background: var(--rust); }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  footer.colophon {\n    border-top: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink);\n    padding: 2rem 0 3rem;\n    font-size: .92rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .colophon-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 2rem;\n  }\n  .colophon h4 {\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-variant: small-caps;\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    margin-bottom: .6rem;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .colophon ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }\n  .colophon li { margin-bottom: .35rem; }\n  .colophon a { text-decoration: none; }\n  .colophon a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }\n  .colophon .sign {\n    font-family: var(--display);\n    font-size: 2.2rem;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: .6rem;\n  }\n  .colophon .legal {\n    margin-top: 2.5rem;\n    padding-top: 1rem;\n    border-top: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink);\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: .5rem;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: .75rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */\n  @media (max-width: 960px) {\n    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    figure.week { max-width: 36rem; }\n    .section-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }\n    .steps, .features, .faq, .pricing, .pricing-note { margin-left: 0; width: 100%; }\n    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .step { border-right: 0; border-bottom: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink); margin-right: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-bottom: 1.6rem; }\n    .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .feature, .feature:nth-child(even) { padding: 1.6rem 0; border-right: 0; }\n    .colophon-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .pricing thead { display: none; }\n    .pricing, .pricing tbody, .pricing tr, .pricing td { display: block; width: 100%; }\n    .pricing tr { border-bottom: var(--rule-thick) solid var(--ink); padding: 1.2rem 0; }\n    .pricing td { border: 0; padding: .3rem 0; }\n    .pricing td .price { font-size: 2rem; }\n    .pricing-note { margin-top: 1.2rem; }\n    nav.primary { gap: .3rem 1.2rem; font-size: .9rem; }\n    form.signup { flex-direction: column; }\n    form.signup button { border-left: 0; border-top: var(--rule-thin) solid var(--ink); padding: .9rem; }\n    .colophon-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"dateline reveal d1\" aria-label=\"Edition\">\n      <span>Vol. I &middot; No. 14</span>\n      <span>For teams of two to nine</span>\n      <span>Monday, 6:00 a.m.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"masthead reveal d2\">\n      <p class=\"name\">Tidepool</p>\n      <p class=\"tagline\">A quiet place to plan the week everyone shares.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <nav class=\"primary reveal d3\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n      <a href=\"#method\">The Method</a>\n      <a href=\"#features\">Features</a>\n      <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a>\n      <a href=\"#begin\">Sign in</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n\n    <!-- HERO -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n      <div class=\"reveal d2\">\n        <span class=\"kicker\">The lead story</span>\n        <h1 id=\"hero-title\">Plan the week together, <em>before</em> Monday plans it for you.</h1>\n        <p class=\"dek\">Tidepool gives small teams one shared page for the coming week: who is doing what, when the quiet hours are, and what has to land by Friday. Write it once on Sunday evening. Read it with your coffee.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-row\">\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#begin\">Start a week, free</a>\n          <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"#method\">Read the method</a>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"fine\">No card required. Built for teams of up to nine.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <figure class=\"week reveal d4\" aria-labelledby=\"fig-cap\">\n        <div class=\"week-head\">\n          <h3>The week of 9 March</h3>\n          <span>Shared sheet</span>\n        </div>\n        <table class=\"plan\">\n          <caption class=\"sr\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\">A sample weekly plan for four people</caption>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Who</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Mon</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Tue</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Wed</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Thu</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Fri</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">Ada</th>\n              <td class=\"ink\">Launch copy</td>\n              <td>Review</td>\n              <td class=\"hatch\">Quiet</td>\n              <td class=\"tide\">Client call</td>\n              <td></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">Ben</th>\n              <td>Onboarding</td>\n              <td class=\"rust\">Bug triage</td>\n              <td>Onboarding</td>\n              <td class=\"hatch\">Quiet</td>\n              <td class=\"ink\">Ship v2</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">Cy</th>\n              <td class=\"hatch\">Out</td>\n              <td class=\"hatch\">Out</td>\n              <td>Budget</td>\n              <td>Budget</td>\n              <td>Retro</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">Dee</th>\n              <td class=\"tide\">Vendor call</td>\n              <td></td>\n              <td class=\"ink\">Interviews</td>\n              <td>Interviews</td>\n              <td class=\"hatch\">Quiet</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"legend\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span><i style=\"background:var(--ink)\"></i>Deadline</span>\n          <span><i style=\"background:var(--rust)\"></i>Blocking</span>\n          <span><i style=\"background:var(--tide)\"></i>Meeting</span>\n          <span><i style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 0 3px,#1c1a17 3px 4px)\"></i>Protected</span>\n        </div>\n        <figcaption id=\"fig-cap\">Fig. 1 \u2014 A sample sheet for four people. Everyone sees the same page.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- METHOD -->\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <section class=\"chapter\" id=\"method\" aria-labelledby=\"method-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div class=\"num\">Part one</div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 id=\"method-title\">The Method</h2>\n          <p style=\"max-width:var(--measure);color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:1.2rem\">Most weekly planning fails in the gap between good intentions and Tuesday morning. Tidepool closes that gap with three unhurried steps, repeated every week.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"steps\">\n        <article class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"roman\" aria-hidden=\"true\">i.</div>\n          <h3>Gather</h3>\n          <p>On Sunday, each person adds what they expect to carry: commitments, deadlines, appointments, and the days they need to be left alone. Nothing is judged. It is simply noted.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"roman\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ii.</div>\n          <h3>Sketch</h3>\n          <p>The team reads the sheet together in a single fifteen-minute sitting. Overlaps surface as small rust marks. Conflicts are moved, traded, or named out loud, while there is still time to fix them.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"roman\" aria-hidden=\"true\">iii.</div>\n          <h3>Commit</h3>\n          <p>Once the sheet is settled, Tidepool locks it and sends a Monday digest to everyone. The plan stops being a draft and becomes the shared agreement for the week.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- FEATURES -->\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <section class=\"chapter\" id=\"features\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div class=\"num\">Part two</div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 id=\"features-title\">What it does, <em>and what it leaves out</em></h2>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"features\">\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Shared sheet</span>\n          <h3>One page, one week</h3>\n          <p>A single grid for the whole team. No duplicated spreadsheets, no thread of screenshots, no wondering which version is current.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Protected time</span>\n          <h3>Quiet hours, respected</h3>\n          <p>Mark blocks as protected and they stay that way. Notifications hold until the block ends, and the sheet shows the block to everyone.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Handoffs</span>\n          <h3>Work that changes hands</h3>\n          <p>When Cy is out Tuesday, Ben's review moves with a note attached. The handoff is recorded on the page, not kept in someone's head.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Monday digest</span>\n          <h3>A briefing, not a barrage</h3>\n          <p>One email per person each Monday, listing only their week. No dashboards to browse, no streaks to maintain.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Retros</span>\n          <h3>A Friday note, kept short</h3>\n          <p>Three prompts at the end of the week: what landed, what slipped, what to carry forward. Past notes are archived by week, like back issues.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"tag\">Restraint</span>\n          <h3>Deliberately absent</h3>\n          <p>No time tracking, no productivity scores, no chat inside the tool. Tidepool is for agreeing on the week. Your existing tools do the rest.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<!-- PULL QUOTE (full bleed) -->\n<section class=\"pull\" aria-label=\"Testimonial\">\n  <blockquote>\n    <p>&ldquo;We used to spend Monday mornings reconstructing the week. Now we spend fifteen minutes on Sunday and nobody asks what they&rsquo;re doing anymore.&rdquo;</p>\n    <cite>Priya Natarajan, operations lead, a six-person design studio</cite>\n  </blockquote>\n</section>\n\n<main>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <!-- PRICING -->\n    <section class=\"chapter\" id=\"pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"pricing-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div class=\"num\">Part three</div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 id=\"pricing-title\">Terms of subscription</h2>\n          <p style=\"max-width:var(--measure);color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:1.2rem\">Priced by the seat, with a free edition for the smallest crews. No tiers hidden behind a phone call.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <table class=\"pricing\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Edition</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Price</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Includes</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"width:16rem\">\n              <span class=\"plan-name\">Tidepool Small</span>\n              <span class=\"pick\">For pairs and trios</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"price\">Free</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Up to three people</li>\n                <li>One shared sheet</li>\n                <li>Monday digest</li>\n                <li>Four weeks of archive</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"width:16rem\">\n              <span class=\"plan-name\">Tidepool Crew</span>\n              <span class=\"pick\">Most teams choose this</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"price\">$6 <small>/ seat / mo</small></span></td>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Up to nine people</li>\n                <li>Protected time and handoffs</li>\n                <li>Friday retros and full archive</li>\n                <li>Export to PDF, as a printed weekly</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <p class=\"pricing-note\">Billed annually or monthly. Cancel any Sunday; your last sheet stays readable.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ -->\n    <section class=\"chapter\" id=\"questions\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div class=\"num\">Part four</div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 id=\"faq-title\">Letters to the editor</h2>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details open>\n          <summary>Does everyone on the team need to pay?</summary>\n          <p>Only seats on the Crew edition are billed. Teammates on the Small edition are free, and you can mix the two within one workspace.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>How is this different from a shared calendar?</summary>\n          <p>A calendar records what has been scheduled. Tidepool records what the team has agreed to do this week, including the work that has no meeting attached, and the time people have asked to keep clear.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>What if our week falls apart on Wednesday?</summary>\n          <p>Edit the sheet. Every change is timestamped and shown in the margin, so the team can see what moved and why without a meeting to explain it.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Can we use it with our existing tools?</summary>\n          <p>Yes. Tasks can link out to your project tracker or document, and the Monday digest can be routed through the email client you already use. Nothing needs to be migrated.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Where is our data kept?</summary>\n          <p>Sheets are stored in the region you choose during setup. You can export everything as plain text or PDF at any time, and deleting a workspace removes it completely within thirty days.</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CLOSING -->\n    <section class=\"closing\" id=\"begin\" aria-labelledby=\"close-title\">\n      <span class=\"kicker\">Next Sunday, at the table</span>\n      <h2 id=\"close-title\">Begin with <em>this</em> week.</h2>\n      <p>Create a workspace, invite your team, and fill in the first sheet before the weekend is over. It takes about as long as reading this page.</p>\n      <form class=\"signup\" action=\"#\" method=\"post\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); this.querySelector('button').textContent='Thank you';\">\n        <label for=\"email\" class=\"sr\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\">Work email</label>\n        <input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@yourteam.com\" required autocomplete=\"email\">\n        <button type=\"submit\">Start free</button>\n      </form>\n      <p class=\"fine\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Free for up to three people. Read our <a href=\"#\" class=\"link-arrow\">privacy note</a>.</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"colophon\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"colophon-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"sign\">Tidepool</p>\n        <p style=\"max-width:24rem;font-style:italic\">Planning for small teams, set in serif and printed nowhere. Made slowly, on purpose.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>The Paper</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#method\">The Method</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Company</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">About</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Changelog</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Fine print</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Privacy</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Terms</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Security</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legal\">\n      <span>&copy; 2025 Tidepool</span>\n      <span>Vol. I &middot; No. 14</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}